# write 4 bytes from register 0x10; nothing answers at 0x51; read the 4 bytes
# back with a repeated START; a byte written to read-only register 0x80 is
# NACKed. After each NACK the controller sends STOP at once.
S 50W A 10 A DE A AD A BE A EF A P
S 51W N P
S 50W A 10 A Sr 50R A DE A AD A BE A EF N P
S 50W A 80 A 55 N P
